Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Yuji Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your ally, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Mechamaru from Kyoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll only say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo has been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us meet again in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night or not, it's time\Nfor you to wake up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to let\Nit keep using you, Suguru?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.02,0:01:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely a first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Code!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mahito, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You once told me you thought the\Nsoul exists before the body does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But really, the body is part of the\Nsoul, and the soul is part of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.63,0:01:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other way to\Nexplain this phenomenon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or the fact that this\Nbody's memories can keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flowing into my mind even\Nafter I swapped out hosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but does that have\Nto be a universal truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of our techniques, we kind\Nof live in two different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So each technique dictates its world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a lovely idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, are we going to do this or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The view sucks and I'm just kind of bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to enjoy this sight for a\Nlittle bit longer, but you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want anything to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.07,0:02:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gate close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so now we can't use this anymore right it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only holds one unless the man inside kills
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himself that's all we\Nget. Oh, that's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:03:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lame well in any case\Nthe ceiling is complete
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.48,0:03:00.62,Main,Geto,0,0,0,,{\an8}The sealing is complete.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.96,0:03:02.96,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 34\N{\fs30\fscy150}Pandemonium
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a special
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.52,0:03:18.03,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,825)\pos(320,10)\3c&H8ECEDD&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs16\bord0\fscy100\c&HDEDCE0&}Shibuya Incident
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my special. The rest\Nof the world, let's go and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world, the world,\Nlet's go and run. Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know, what it's all about me say again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love it, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die. You are all love. I make a\Nsoul for God. You are my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, yeah, no, my love's the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, it's always come, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Day, it should make you\Ndie. You are all love. And
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it for God. You are\Nmy special. We are special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're talking about satoru Kinji here\Nwhat proof do you have for me to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you sorry but i don't have any the only\Nthing i can offer is the very fact that i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here i was killed on october 19th by the\Nspecial great cursed spirit called mahito
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:05:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's here is no more than the insurance\Ni left when i was still alive this was my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,contingency plan i had no choice but to\Nset its condition to activate after satoru
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gojo has been sealed to decrease the risk\Nof a malfunction i limited the position of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these puppets to three\Nlocations yuji itadori
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was the least likely jujutsu high sorcerer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to leak any information and may may given
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the situation i'm now\Ncertain you're in the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clear, too. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because someone as skilled at intelligence\Ngathering as you was dispatched
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.45,0:05:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here to Meiji Shrine Station instead\Nof acting in the shadows at Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Itadori wasn't even a part of\NJujutsu Society until several months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but what if I was just simply
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,refusing to follow orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I've been the one stopping\NItadori from going straight
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to Shibuya this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though we were\Nordered to be on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then explain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is a curse user currently\Nheading your way to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One and two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I count two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.09,0:06:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Itadori, which is stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these two approaching now or the\Ncursed spirit you fought earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're probably stronger\Nthan that grasshopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cursed spirit Itadori thought\Nwas able to speak human languages,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it was semi-first-grade\Nor higher at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And things like that are now\Ncrawling out of the woodwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to wonder where they've\Nbeen hiding this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go ahead and ignore\Nthe cursed users for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to confirm Gojo's status first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The situation in Shibuya\Nhas already changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their barrier techniques are\Nseveral degrees better than ours.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.13,0:06:52.89,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(339,168)\c&HD4D6D6&\3c&H000000&\bord2\shad0\fnArial\fs16}Shibuya Station
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are currently four\Nveils lowered over Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, the veil-trapping civilians inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, the veil-trapping Satoru Gojo inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, the veil-barring\Nsorcerers from entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And four, another veil like one to\Nkeep common people trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're saying the area further down\Nthese tracks is blocked by veil three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sorcerers on standby are already\Ninside the veil, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can't use cell\Nphones inside the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it looks like that's not all either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.55,0:07:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't contact the assistant\Nsupervisors waiting outside the veils.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just follow my directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My contingency plan\Nwon't last long. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meimei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.99,0:07:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.43,0:07:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.61,0:07:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, return to Meiji Shrine Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then head to Shibuya from the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell all the sorcerers there\Nabout Gojo being sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.97,0:07:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Convince them they must\Ncollaborate to rescue Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.25,0:07:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meili, create an opportunity\Nfor Itadori to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:08:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After defeating the curse users, I'd like\Nyou to manage things out here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what moves\Nthe enemy will make.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll adapt and respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, they haven't frozen\Nyour bank account yet, have they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Satoru Gojo disappears,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Jujutsu world and the human\Nworld will both be upended.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to please\Nstake your life on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to think it would be okay\Nif everything was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.19,0:08:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, anything for me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow whoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix this news!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone. Incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Mei-Mei, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll match you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.10,0:08:47.85,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an1\fs30\bord0\shad0\pos(32,250)}21:26\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\fs22}Tokyo Metro, Shibuya Station\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hB5F, Shin-toshin Line Platform
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're all awake.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.47,Main,Geto,0,0,0,,{\an8}Looks like you're all awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.25,0:08:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, for our next... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like physical time\Ndoesn't pass inside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, did I screw up or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is all kinds of bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it'll all work out somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have faith in everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.11,0:09:36.99,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1c&H75EFED&\3c&H75EFED&\blur20\1a&HE0&\3a&HC0&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.11,0:09:36.99,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1a&HFF&\3c&HC5E3EC&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.11,0:09:36.99,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(675,0)\3c&H1EDDF0&\pos(320,18)\c&H292619&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.99,0:09:40.75,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,146)\fnArial\b1\bord0}21:22 Shibuya
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.85,0:09:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even accounting for those\Ntrapped inside the station,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.57,0:09:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the number of people there was quite low.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The transfigured humans were lying\Nin wait inside the buildings,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:10:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now they started attacking\Nthe non-sorcerers, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our orders are to stop standing\Nby and start attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There wasn't much else we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our response is starting\Nto fall too far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have an even bigger concern.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.99,Main,Ino,0,0,0,,{\an8}The veil—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The veil keeping sorcerers out\Nthat was lowered at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been a while now since\NSatoru Gojo arrived at the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd they choose now of all times?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either something has happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or they needed to wait long enough for\Nthis moment as part of their strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can say for certain, these aren't\Nthe types to face us without a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll focus on the enemies\Nwho lowered the veils.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two, please rescue\Nall the civilians you can.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.52,0:10:48.52,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,146)\fnArial\b1\bord0}All Three Teams Enter Simultaneously
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you've confirmed the situation,\Nplease exit the Vale again, Nita.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the signal blocked inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.65,0:11:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll constantly need someone\Non the outside working with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Specifically, I'd like\Nyou to take on that role.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do whatever it takes to establish a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,communication network with\Nthe assistant supervisors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be possible if\Nwe mobilize those off-duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullying the weak really\Nis the perfect job for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you all want, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hunt down all the\Nhumans wearing suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll find them all standing\Noutside the veil's perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can go inside when\NI'm finished, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seal is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Prison Realm still\Nhasn't finished processing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of the information\Nthat is Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to move it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Score one for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, good news. Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.21,0:12:35.93,Italics,Mechamaru,0,0,0,,{\an8}They can't move Gojo from \Nwhere he was sealed on floor B5.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.21,0:12:38.46,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnArial\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(611,302)}21:27 Between Meiji Shrine and Shibuya Stations
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't move Gojo from where he\Nwas sealed on floor B5. Why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.93,0:12:36.70,Main,Yuji,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because he's Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.70,0:12:38.46,Italics,Mechamaru,0,0,0,,{\an8}Because he's Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.45,0:12:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's encircle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have sorcerers\Nfollow the subway lines
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into Shibuya from each\Nneighboring station.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.98,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\shad0\fnArial\fs18\c&H31312F&\3c&HF8F4EC&\fscx93\pos(227,27)}Shin-toshin Line \NMeiji Jingu Station
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.98,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\fscx80\shad0\fnArial\fs18\c&H31312F&\3c&HF8F4EC&\pos(477,58)}Fukubumon Line \NOmotesando Station
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.98,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\fscx80\shad0\fnArial\fs18\c&H31312F&\3c&HF8F4EC&\pos(491,174)}Seiyoko Line \NDaikanyama Station
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.98,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord4\fscx85\shad0\fnArial\fs18\c&H31312F&\3c&HF8F4EC&\pos(183,288)}Den-en-toshin Line \NIkejiri-ohashi Station
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.47,0:12:49.98,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord2\shad0\b1\3c&H31312F&\c&HF8F4EC&\pos(322,158)}Shibuya Station
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the veil keeping sorcerers\Nout is lifted, we charge in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have sorcerers follow them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't get a hold of Ijichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have any idea\Nwho was sent to Shibuya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today you call for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NANAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NANAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NANAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NANAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? NANAMI?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gojo is in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.83,0:14:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been sealed. He's been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two, change of plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to meet up with Itadori at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.31,0:14:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's true that Gojo's been sealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it's over for every\Nhuman in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, now they know what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:15:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sorcerers are going to\Nbe coming here in full force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be staying behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge my younger brothers by\Nkilling Yuji Itadori and Nobara Kugisaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll make my way to\NJujutsu High and release
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rest of my brothers\Nfrom their captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about\NKugisaki. But we're turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.63,0:15:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori into Sukuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.65,0:15:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jogo, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I think I want\Nto kill Itadori too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mahito, you're not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I could tell after\Nseeing Satoru Gojo in person,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that he's sealed away for good, the\Nsorcerers and cursed spirits are even.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.27,0:15:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Sukuna is resurrected,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.93,0:15:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll have a huge advantage and\Nvictory is basically ours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's true. But then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't that mean we're perfectly capable\Nof winning with the forces we have now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's kill Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:16:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we lose Sook now, we're still\Nin a position to win the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As serious as I can possibly be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be the one smiling\Nin the Wasteland a century from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.53,0:16:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as curses can live as\Npeople, that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna isn't actually our ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might even be the ones who are facing\Ngreater risk if he does become resurrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if Sukuna does get resurrected,\Nthe age of curses is guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are not like the humans of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do not fear death, and we follow the\Npath to our goals without falsehoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is the essence of us\Nolder curses that those fakes lack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.93,0:16:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how off-kilter or\Ninconsistent we've become,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we always act in strict accordance\Nwith our truest desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.09,0:16:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.35,0:17:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, when I said you were wrong, I\Nmeant regarding what curses are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree that the whole resurrection\Nthing is a good strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I really don't want\Nto fight you over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how about we play a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I find Itadori first, then\NI get to kill him like I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you find him first, you can give him the\Nfingers and let Sukuna regain his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.87,0:17:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I find him first,\NI get to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want in too, Choso?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.53,0:17:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're more on Jogo's side if\Nyou had to pick, right, Code?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.39,0:17:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to remain here to\Nwatch over the prison realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.91,0:17:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll abstain from the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with whatever you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna was always just the backup\Nplan in case the prison realm failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the sorcerers, including Itadori,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be headed this way to\Nsave Gojo, and we're arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all you have to do is wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't be really a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those cursed spirits are actually smarter\Nthan the two of you. Give him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cooperated with you fully and\Nkept dropping monkeys for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now give us back Master\NGato's body like you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't toy with Master Code\Nany further than you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.73,0:18:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I'm keeping him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't recall leaving either of\Nyour heads empty, but maybe I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time you make a\Npromise with a sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should make sure it's a\Npact that can never be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be gone or is it your desire\Nto be killed by this body?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.53,0:18:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regret? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what did regret taste like again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:18:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NANAMI! NANAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:18:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NANAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NANAMI! Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hey, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NANAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro! Kento dude! And who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really refer to NANAMI like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Code did?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be more precise, the thing\Nthat's living within Suguru Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.13,0:19:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shibuya Station is in\NPandemonium right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's full of those special grades,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cursed spirits they brought with\Nthem, the curse users tied to Code,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as transfigured\Nhumans and normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'd be faster to attack through the\Nsubway from the neighboring stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to do that, we need to find\Na way to lift that veil first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.39,0:19:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please multitask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess this isn't the time for complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are several things only a\Nfirst-grade sorcerer can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to step outside\Nand take care of this with Ijichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:20:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you three to do something\Nabout the veil keeping sorcerers out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ino.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kusakabe and special first-grade sorcerer\NZenin should be inside this veil as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're able to meet up with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please relay this situation and\Nrequest their immediate help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Itadori's shouting,\NI'm sure they already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.63,0:20:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, take care of these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fright!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ina?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nanami is counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.99,0:20:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we start the mission, let me\Nmake it clear how important this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.97,0:20:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Losing Gojo creates two major issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.09,0:20:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, the collapse of the Gojo clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gojo clan is currently a\None-man team of Satoru Gojo himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are lots of sorcerers who have\Nbeen saved due to Gojo's influence,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.54,Sign_Basic,Our topic,0,0,0,,{\an8\move(320,-34,320,164)\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0\b1\c&H000000&}Throughout Heaven and Earth, I Alone Am the Honored One
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pride, and wimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, you're one of\Nthose sorcerers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.63,0:20:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Casual, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.67,0:20:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of those people he saved are going\Nto find themselves in some major trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the worst case...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That brings us to Issue 2, the\Ncollapse of the power battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the cursed spirits and\Ncurse users who've been keeping
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quiet because Gojo was around will\Nstart taking action all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if the guys from\NIssue 2 try starting a war,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while society is in disarray\Nfrom fighting over Issue 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the future Nanami and I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think happens if we lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would imagine at the very least that\Nthe age of humans would be over for Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.81,0:21:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see I've taught you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us will break that\Nbill before Nanami gets back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's rescue Satoru Gojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.31,0:22:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.93,0:23:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Awasaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.81,0:23:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo has been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're leaking information\Nto their enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.49,0:23:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that, old Ogami?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.89,0:23:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally starting to feel real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo really has been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.11,0:23:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's going to\Nhappen to this country now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing new will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People will still curse,\Nbe cursed, and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said Gojo's little Satoru was sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.37,0:23:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, I always thought that\Nwould happen to that boy one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was always flaunting his style,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.91,0:23:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,acting like he was nothing\Nbut leg below his nipples.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.01,0:23:54.89,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Seance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.31,0:23:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, seance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.45,0:23:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Code, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.77,0:23:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gojo's little...

